WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.442
The bunnies hopped to the farm.

2
00:00:08.443 --> 00:00:11.693
"Jemima!" Benjamin called.

3
00:00:11.694 --> 00:00:14.442
"We are looking for an old boot."

4
00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:17.137
"Oh," Jemima said.

5
00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:19.884
"I wanted to make a nest in that boot.

6
00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.762
But it was too small for my eggs."

7
00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:24.729
"Great!" Peter said.

8
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.802
"Can we have the boot?"

9
00:00:26.803 --> 00:00:29.385
"No," Jemima said.

10
00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:34.050
"I gave the boot to Tom Kitten.

11
00:00:34.051 --> 00:00:42.827
He gave me hay."

12
00:00:42.828 --> 00:00:49.595
The bunnies hopped away.

13
00:00:49.596 --> 00:00:53.083
They found Tom near some big rocks.

14
00:00:53.084 --> 00:01:03.903
"Do you have the boot?" Benjamin called.

15
00:01:03.904 --> 00:01:08.098
Tom nodded sadly.

16
00:01:08.099 --> 00:01:11.907
"Yes, but . . ."

17
00:01:11.908 --> 00:01:14.203
He pointed to the boot.

18
00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:17.237
It was stuck between two rocks.

19
00:01:17.238 --> 00:01:20.480
"We need that boot!" Peter said.

20
00:01:20.481 --> 00:01:26.341
"Can we have it?" Benjamin asked.

21
00:01:26.342 --> 00:01:29.505
"Okay," Tom said.

22
00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:33.541
"I will give you the boot.

23
00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:36.421
Will you give me some candy?"

24
00:01:36.422 --> 00:01:40.700
"Okay." Peter reached into his pockets.

25
00:01:40.701 --> 00:01:47.111
He gasped. "Where is all my candy?"

26
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:51.816
Peter had just one piece left.

27
00:01:51.817 --> 00:01:58.287
He gave it to Tom.

28
00:01:58.288 --> 00:02:03.844
"Bye!" Tom said.

29
00:02:03.845 --> 00:02:06.306
The bunnies grabbed the boot.

30
00:02:06.307 --> 00:02:16.271
They pulled hard.

31
00:02:16.272 --> 00:02:20.094
But it was still stuck!

